config TEST_POSIX_PROFILE_SUBTRACT
	bool "The chosen subprofile has Option Groups disabled on top of it"
	help
	  Set by the profile_subtract scenario: PSE52 with message passing and asynchronous
	  I/O disabled. The build asserts that the subtracted profile no longer claims PSE51
	  or PSE52 conformance while the base System Interfaces remain claimed.

